# Build output and generated files, the same two directories
# `.eslintrc.json` ignores here and for the same reason.
#
# This file exists rather than pointing prettier at the root `.gitignore` with
# `--ignore-path ../.gitignore`, which works but puts a `../` path in a
# package.json script, and fallow reads those scripts looking for entry points
# and warns about every one it cannot resolve. A warning on every run that
# nobody can act on is one everybody stops reading.
